.el .ds Aq '
.TH quarters-discover 1  "quarters-discover " 
.SH NAME
quarters\-discover \- Measure privacy\-bounded Quarter\-owned state changes from one command
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBquarters\-discover\fR [\fB\-\-home\-view\fR] [\fB\-\-confinement\fR] [\fB\-\-inherit\fR] [\fB\-\-grant\-path\fR] [\fB\-\-workdir\fR] [\fB\-\-scan\fR] [\fB\-\-report\-fd\fR] [\fB\-\-preview\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] <\fINAME\fR> [\fICOMMAND\fR] 
.SH DESCRIPTION
Measure privacy\-bounded Quarter\-owned state changes from one command
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-home\-view\fR
Opt into Linux\*(Aqs experimental bind\-mounted passwd\-home view
.TP
\fB\-\-confinement\fR \fI<CONFINEMENT>\fR
Enforce the named native filesystem policy; defaults to the Quarter home
.br

.br
\fIPossible values:\fR
.RS 14
.IP \(bu 2
filesystem: Linux Landlock ABI 3 path policy; unavailable on macOS
.RE
.TP
\fB\-\-inherit\fR \fI<NAME>\fR
Explicitly inherit one otherwise\-blocked host environment variable
.TP
\fB\-\-grant\-path\fR \fI<ABSOLUTE_PATH:ro|rw>\fR
Admit one existing absolute host data path to Linux confinement
.TP
\fB\-\-workdir\fR \fI<ABSOLUTE_PATH>\fR
Start the shell or command in this existing absolute directory
.TP
\fB\-\-scan\fR \fI<SCANS>\fR
Quarter\-owned root to scan; repeat to select both. Defaults to both
.br

.br
\fIPossible values:\fR
.RS 14
.IP \(bu 2
home: Scan the virtual home directory
.IP \(bu 2
runtime: Scan the private XDG runtime directory
.RE
.TP
\fB\-\-report\-fd\fR \fI<FD>\fR
Write the stable JSON report to an inherited writable descriptor (3 or higher)
.TP
\fB\-\-preview\fR
Inspect scope, limits, and credential\-shaped patterns without running a command
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help (see a summary with \*(Aq\-h\*(Aq)
.TP
<\fINAME\fR>
Space to inspect or launch
.TP
[\fICOMMAND\fR]
Command and arguments. Put `\-\-` before options meant for the command
